 "intro_zh": "六盘山是一座历史名山，很多古代诗词里出现过它的身姿，秦皇汉武、成吉思汗在这里留下过足迹。1935年8月至1936年10月，红二十五军、中央红军（陕甘支队）、西征红军、红二方面军四次经过六盘山区，开启了奠基大西北的革命新篇章，六盘山因此被誉为“曙光之山”“胜利之山”。",
 "intro_en": "Liupan Mountain is a famous historical mountain. It appears in many ancient poems. Emperors of Qin, Han, Wu and Genghis Khan left their footprints here. From August 1935 to October 1936, the 25th Red Army, the Central Red Army (Shaanxi-Gansu Detachment), the Western Expedition Red Army, and the Second Red Front Army passed through Liupanshan District four times, opening a new chapter in the revolution that laid the foundation for the Northwest. Liupanshan was therefore known as the \"Mountain of Dawn\" and \"The Mountain of Victory.\"",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
